{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PACK IT, SAIL IT, SELL IT\u2014PACK AGAIN\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAFT DAYS COMBINES SOKOBAN PUZZLES WITH A TRADING SIMULATION.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOAD ALL KINDS OF GOODS ONTO YOUR OWN RAFT AND TRAVEL THE WORLD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy laid-back days with a Sokoban puzzle \u00d7 trading simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out onto the open sea on a pocket-sized raft with a little money and rations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Sokoban-style puzzles at a relaxed pace to buy and sell goods and savor the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you run out of food, you\u2019ll starve. Whether you load rations or cargo will put your judgment to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/d51c05876d007783b2436d20d6c3e105.poster.avif?t=1756467758\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/d51c05876d007783b2436d20d6c3e105.webm?t=1756467758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/d51c05876d007783b2436d20d6c3e105.mp4?t=1756467758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can\u2019t load everything. What will you do?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you stow cargo on the raft is the key to keeping your long voyage going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you push valuable goods too far to the back, you might not be able to sell them when you need to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >After all, the basics of business are \u201cbuy low, sell high\u201d!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which goods you purchase is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014if you can\u2019t pay your taxes, your journey ends right there\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/e626df929bfa9f649a293bab7ce844bb.poster.avif?t=1756467758\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/e626df929bfa9f649a293bab7ce844bb.webm?t=1756467758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/e626df929bfa9f649a293bab7ce844bb.mp4?t=1756467758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A major demo update is planned for September! Set off on an even greater adventure!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The world you travel changes every time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be able to chart your own course across the open sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail through a world of ports that is randomly generated each run and fill in the world map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/bc15677a8b363832dc2c16642c54074d.poster.avif?t=1756467758\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/bc15677a8b363832dc2c16642c54074d.webm?t=1756467758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/bc15677a8b363832dc2c16642c54074d.mp4?t=1756467758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do you enjoy filling out a mysterious collection, one entry at a time?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item you trade is recorded in your Compendium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing the collection proves you\u2019ve traveled the whole world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your ideal raft!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your raft starts small, but you can enlarge it during your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goods you couldn\u2019t carry at the beginning might all fit later!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To reach more players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We currently support English and Japanese only, but the next update is planned to add Chinese support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Stay tuned!</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728350?t=1756467758","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728350?t=1756467758","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/030c097941812f73d6576181257045e3963508d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756467758","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/030c097941812f73d6576181257045e3963508d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756467758","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PACK IT, SAIL IT, SELL IT\u2014PACK AGAIN\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAFT DAYS COMBINES SOKOBAN PUZZLES WITH A TRADING SIMULATION.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOAD ALL KINDS OF GOODS ONTO YOUR OWN RAFT AND TRAVEL THE WORLD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy laid-back days with a Sokoban puzzle \u00d7 trading simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out onto the open sea on a pocket-sized raft with a little money and rations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Sokoban-style puzzles at a relaxed pace to buy and sell goods and savor the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you run out of food, you\u2019ll starve. Whether you load rations or cargo will put your judgment to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/d51c05876d007783b2436d20d6c3e105.poster.avif?t=1756467758\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/d51c05876d007783b2436d20d6c3e105.webm?t=1756467758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/d51c05876d007783b2436d20d6c3e105.mp4?t=1756467758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can\u2019t load everything. What will you do?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you stow cargo on the raft is the key to keeping your long voyage going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you push valuable goods too far to the back, you might not be able to sell them when you need to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >After all, the basics of business are \u201cbuy low, sell high\u201d!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which goods you purchase is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014if you can\u2019t pay your taxes, your journey ends right there\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/e626df929bfa9f649a293bab7ce844bb.poster.avif?t=1756467758\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/e626df929bfa9f649a293bab7ce844bb.webm?t=1756467758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/e626df929bfa9f649a293bab7ce844bb.mp4?t=1756467758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A major demo update is planned for September! Set off on an even greater adventure!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The world you travel changes every time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be able to chart your own course across the open sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail through a world of ports that is randomly generated each run and fill in the world map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/bc15677a8b363832dc2c16642c54074d.poster.avif?t=1756467758\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/bc15677a8b363832dc2c16642c54074d.webm?t=1756467758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/extras/bc15677a8b363832dc2c16642c54074d.mp4?t=1756467758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do you enjoy filling out a mysterious collection, one entry at a time?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item you trade is recorded in your Compendium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing the collection proves you\u2019ve traveled the whole world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your ideal raft!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your raft starts small, but you can enlarge it during your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goods you couldn\u2019t carry at the beginning might all fit later!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To reach more players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We currently support English and Japanese only, but the next update is planned to add Chinese support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Stay tuned!</i></strong></p>","developers":["KAYAC Inc."],"fullgame":{"appid":"3675920","name":"RAFT Days"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728350/2b6f081aa421f2458c2cc8f36f8bb427aec5f194/header.jpg?t=1756467758","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257190607,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190607/movie480.mp4?t=1756467225","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190607/movie_max.mp4?t=1756467225"},"name":"RAFTDays_short","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257190607/87b7fb3a76b779794a866ab488f242d0d651407a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756467225","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190607/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756467225","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190607/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756467225"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257190606,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190606/movie480.mp4?t=1756467227","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190606/movie_max.mp4?t=1756467227"},"name":"RAFTDays_long","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257190606/87b7fb3a76b779794a866ab488f242d0d651407a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756467227","webm":